  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building in Climate Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Initiate the process of enabling the design and mobilization of resources for climate-resilient rural water and sanitation interventions in the most climate-affected provinces of Mozambique.

Conduct a situational assessment of the impacts, vulnerabilities, and climate readiness in the selected provinces  as well as map the exposure, sensitivity, and adaptive capacity of rural water and sanitation systems to cyclones, floods, and droughts.</narrative>
  </description>
